# Phase 0 (ledger + tests) needs NOTHING beyond the Python 3.9+ standard library.
# The packages below are for Phase 1+ (perception) and are optional until then.

# Phase 1 — perception:
watchdog>=4.0        # OS-level file events (event-driven; replaces polling)
PyYAML>=6.0          # read genome/*.yaml

# Optional (Phase 1 semantic memory — add only if you want vector search):
# sentence-transformers>=3.0   # local embeddings (free, runs on the laptop)
# sqlite-vec>=0.1              # vector index inside the same SQLite file

# Backup (Phase 4) — installed as OS tools, not pip:
#   restic  or  rclone (with crypt)  for the encrypted off-site copy
